# Quality loop

Follow `AGENTS.md` § Quality. After behavior changes, before stopping (commit only if the user asked):

1. Add or extend Minitest.
2. `bin/rails test`
3. `bin/rubocop` (or `bin/rubocop -A path` for files you touched)
4. No ESLint/Prettier. `bin/importmap audit` only if JS dependencies changed.

`bin/ci` is a CI-style local check, not a clone of GitHub Actions (GitHub runs system tests; `bin/ci` replants seeds and skips system tests).
